// IT8 - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# IT8 is a colour-measurement chart format: a text file whose header is
# a run of fixed-length columns, each beginning with a field tag.
#
#   #CTI_status	final
#   #LogisticConversionValue	...
#
# The greeting is the chart's description field, which is free text.
#CTI_status	final
#Description	Hello World!
